// W4d surface fold-in — reserved `data` operation and 2-cell members.
//
// GRADUATION: these members PARSE now (wyrd-ku0f) so the datatype block never
// needs re-parsing when their semantics land, but they are parse-and-decline
// today. `op` operations and `rule` rewrites graduate under wyrd-7xl7
// (equational / operator theories). Parse-only; never lowered.
//
// The named multi-output result that once sat here has left this tree: it now
// elaborates, so it runs as `pathological/desc/many-out-op-declined.gandr` —
// well-formed as a description, and declined at the cell layer.

// Reserved `op` operation member: `op name(params) -> Result`.
data NatOp { Zero, Succ(n: NatOp), op add(m: NatOp, n: NatOp) -> NatOp }

// Reserved `rule` 2-cell member: `rule lhs ~> rhs` (a directed rewrite).
data NatRule { Zero, Succ(n: NatRule), rule id(Zero) ~> Zero }
